nk","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji052-034:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"楊虛侯","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0019","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"explicit_end","date_expression":"後一歲","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0019"}]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、任事、提議、回敘及用稱分開；年號僅留原語，不反算公曆起訖。朱虛、東牟許封趙梁而未實現不記實授，死亡不自動終止全部稱號。章與興居授王兩處年表述各留原段，不擅調和。 原侯號轉王號依本段明示封王判讀終點，不由死亡或其他官職任事推全部稱號終止。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji052-035","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","title":"齊王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji052-035:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"齊王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0019","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":"後一歲","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、任事、提議、回敘及用稱分開；年號僅留原語，不反算公曆起訖。朱虛、東牟許封趙梁而未實現不記實授，死亡不自動終止全部稱號。章與興居授王兩處年表述各留原段，不擅調和。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji105-028","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","title":"齊王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","source_id":"s-shiji-105-bianque","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p037","quote":"齊王故為陽虛侯時，病甚，眾醫皆以為蹷。臣意診脈，以為痹，根在右脅下，大如覆杯，令人喘，逆氣不能食。臣意即以火齊粥且飲，六日氣下；即令更服丸藥，出入六日，病已。病得之內。診之時不能識其經解，大識其病所在。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji105-028:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p037","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"齊王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m037-0000","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依原文保存爵位、王號及身分用稱；齊王故為陽虛侯明示前後用稱，但未據此補起訖年或自行判定封爵終止事件。齊桓侯身分爭議與命婦、美人分類仍待覆核，不以官職中的侯字轉成封爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji105-029","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","title":"陽虛侯","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","source_id":"s-shiji-105-bianque","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p037","quote":"齊王故為陽虛侯時，病甚，眾醫皆以為蹷。臣意診脈，以為痹，根在右脅下，大如覆杯，令人喘，逆氣不能食。臣意即以火齊粥且飲，六日氣下；即令更服丸藥，出入六日，病已。病得之內。診之時不能識其經解，大識其病所在。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji105-029:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p037","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"陽虛侯","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m037-0000","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依原文保存爵位、王號及身分用稱；齊王故為陽虛侯明示前後用稱，但未據此補起訖年或自行判定封爵終止事件。齊桓侯身分爭議與命婦、美人分類仍待覆核，不以官職中的侯字轉成封爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[{"id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05-review-007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"將閭","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本格受封者本名與舊侯號同指，與052本名及前爵對讀；平昌與昌平、扐與勒等字序或字形各依見證保留，不將姓名當全域別名。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。","source_revision":5977113}],"table_id":"shiji-017","table_fragment_id":"shiji-017-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-017","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-017","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-017","source_revision":"2607010","kind":"table_person_mention","quote":"四月丙寅，孝王將閭元年。齊悼惠王子，故陽虛侯。"},{"id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05-review-019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"陽虛侯","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本格受封者本名與舊侯號同指，與052本名及前爵對讀；平昌與昌平、扐與勒等字序或字形各依見證保留，不將姓名當全域別名。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。","source_revision":5977113}],"table_id":"shiji-017","table_fragment_id":"shiji-017-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-017","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-017","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-017","source_revision":"2607010","kind":"table_person_mention","quote":"四月丙寅，孝王將閭元年。齊悼惠王子，故陽虛侯。"}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji052-023","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","surfaces":["孝王","齊孝王","齊孝王將閭","齊王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p025","quote":"齊孝王十一年，吳王濞、楚王戊反，興兵西，告諸侯曰「將誅漢賊臣晁錯以安宗廟」。膠西、膠東、菑川、濟南皆擅發兵應吳楚。欲與齊，齊孝王狐疑，城守不聽，三國兵共圍齊。齊王使路中大夫告於天子。天子復令路中大夫還告齊王：「善堅守，吾兵今破吳楚矣。」路中大夫至，三國兵圍臨菑數重，無從入。三國將劫與路中大夫盟，曰：「若反言漢已破矣，齊趣下三國，不且見屠。」路中大夫既許之，至城下，望見齊王，曰：「漢已發兵百萬，使太尉周亞夫擊破吳楚，方引兵救齊，齊必堅守無下！」三國將誅路中大夫。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p026","quote":"齊初圍急，陰與三國通謀，約未定，會聞路中大夫從漢來，喜，及其大臣乃復勸王毋下三國。居無何，漢將欒布、平陽侯等兵至齊，擊破三國兵，解齊圍。已而復聞齊初與三國有謀，將欲移兵伐齊。齊孝王懼，乃飲藥自殺。景帝聞之，以為齊首善，以迫劫有謀，非其罪也，乃立孝王太子壽為齊王，是為懿王，續齊後。而膠西、膠東、濟南、菑川王咸誅滅，地入于漢。徙濟北王王菑川。齊懿王立二十二年卒，子次景立，是為厲王。"}],"rationale":"依明示名與王國、世次的局部敘事暫接；齊、城陽與菑川同諡者分開，興居與志分開。校勘建延及內史勳士未擅選讀法，未名帝后不補姓名，案件只保存來源敘事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji105-061","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","surfaces":["齊王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-105-bianque"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p037","quote":"齊王故為陽虛侯時，病甚，眾醫皆以為蹷。臣意診脈，以為痹，根在右脅下，大如覆杯，令人喘，逆氣不能食。臣意即以火齊粥且飲，六日氣下；即令更服丸藥，出入六日，病已。病得之內。診之時不能識其經解，大識其病所在。"}],"rationale":"依本篇姓名、原稱及敘事回指暫定；醫案引語與附載注釋分層，未按同名自動跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji105-yangxu-context","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","surfaces":["陽虛侯","侯"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-105-bianque","c-shiji-052-qidaohui"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-105","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","source_id":"s-shiji-105-bianque","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p037","quote":"齊王故為陽虛侯時，病甚，眾醫皆以為蹷。臣意診脈，以為痹，根在右脅下，大如覆杯，令人喘，逆氣不能食。臣意即以火齊粥且飲，六日氣下；即令更服丸藥，出入六日，病已。病得之內。診之時不能識其經解，大識其病所在。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-105-bianque:m037-0004"]},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-105","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","source_id":"s-shiji-105-bianque","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p043","quote":"問臣意：「意方能知病死生，論藥用所宜，諸侯王大臣有嘗問意者不？及文王病時，不求意診治，何故？」對曰：「趙王、膠西王、濟南王、吳王皆使人來召臣意，臣意不敢往。文王病時，臣意家貧，欲為人治病，誠恐吏以除拘臣意也，故移名數，左右不修家生，出行游國中，問善為方數者事之久矣，見事數師，悉受其要事，盡其方書意，及解論之。身居陽虛侯國，因事侯。侯入朝，臣意從之長安，以故得診安陵項處等病也。」","mention_ids":["c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0164","c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0166"]},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0019"]}],"rationale":"本篇齊王故為陽虛侯與052楊虛侯將閭為齊王相合；文王病時倉公居陽虛侯國並事侯、隨侯入朝，兩處侯承該封侯人物。陽楊原字分存，侯國為地名不拆人名；不據本病案補醫治絕對年或整章齊王身份。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji105-core-013","person_ids":["jc7_nxq_532"],"canonical_person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui","c-shiji-105-bianque"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0019"]},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-105","chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","source_id":"s-shiji-105-bianque","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p037","quote":"齊王故為陽虛侯時，病甚，眾醫皆以為蹷。臣意診脈，以為痹，根在右脅下，大如覆杯，令人喘，逆氣不能食。臣意即以火齊粥且飲，六日氣下；即令更服丸藥，出入六日，病已。病得之內。診之時不能識其經解，大識其病所在。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-105-bianque:m037-0000"]}],"rationale":"105p037齊王故為陽虛侯與052齊孝王將閭以楊虛侯為齊王具體前後封號相配，僅接本處獨立ID；陽楊原字分存，不把全章泛稱齊王合為一人，也不據此填病案絕對年。 原文、夢中引語與古注分層；同一傳承不當獨立史實證成，不補生卒、夢境人物血親或診病絕對年；未核書影。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"identity_materialized":true}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","text":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"28d_4fi_xdp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0019","start":19,"end":24,"surface":"齊孝王將閭","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABH","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"辟光","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"賢","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"卬","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m024-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"雄渠","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABE","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","book_id":"b-shiji-052","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p025","text":"齊孝王十一年，吳王濞、楚王戊反，興兵西，告諸侯曰「將誅漢賊臣晁錯以安宗廟」。膠西、膠東、菑川、濟南皆擅發兵應吳楚。欲與齊，齊孝王狐疑，城守不聽，三國兵共圍齊。齊王使路中大夫告於天子。天子復令路中大夫還告齊王：「善堅守，吾兵今破吳楚矣。」路中大夫至，三國兵圍臨菑數重，無從入。三國將劫與路中大夫盟，曰：「若反言漢已破矣，齊趣下三國，不且見屠。」路中大夫既許之，至城下，望見齊王，曰：「漢已發兵百萬，使太尉周亞夫擊破吳楚，方引兵救齊，齊必堅守無下！」三國將誅路中大夫。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"齊孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"吳王濞","kind":"person","person_id":"l9w_b0y_aow","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"楚王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"qa2_bme_epc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"晁錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0061","start":61,"end":64,"surface":"齊孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0082","start":82,"end":86,"surface":"路中大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"agr_7ae_9ur","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0095","start":95,"end":99,"surface":"路中大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"agr_7ae_9ur","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0118","start":118,"end":122,"surface":"路中大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"agr_7ae_9ur","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0137","start":137,"end":140,"surface":"三國將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0142","start":142,"end":146,"surface":"路中大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"agr_7ae_9ur","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0171","start":171,"end":175,"surface":"路中大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"agr_7ae_9ur","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0185","start":185,"end":187,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0199","start":199,"end":204,"surface":"太尉周亞夫","kind":"person","person_id":"mvv_bou_spk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0223","start":223,"end":226,"surface":"三國將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m025-0227","start":227,"end":231,"surface":"路中大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"agr_7ae_9ur","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","book_id":"b-shiji-052","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p026","text":"齊初圍急，陰與三國通謀，約未定，會聞路中大夫從漢來，喜，及其大臣乃復勸王毋下三國。居無何，漢將欒布、平陽侯等兵至齊，擊破三國兵，解齊圍。已而復聞齊初與三國有謀，將欲移兵伐齊。齊孝王懼，乃飲藥自殺。景帝聞之，以為齊首善，以迫劫有謀，非其罪也，乃立孝王太子壽為齊王，是為懿王，續齊後。而膠西、膠東、濟南、菑川王咸誅滅，地入于漢。徙濟北王王菑川。齊懿王立二十二年卒，子次景立，是為厲王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0018","start":18,"end":22,"surface":"路中大夫","kind":"person","person_id":"agr_7ae_9ur","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"大臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"欒布","kind":"person","person_id":"jx9_cov_qe0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"平陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"5dq_f5i_bkh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0087","start":87,"end":90,"surface":"齊孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0126","start":126,"end":127,"surface":"壽","kind":"person","person_id":"qok_ik2_99j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"懿王","kind":"person","person_id":"qok_ik2_99j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"懿王","kind":"person","person_id":"qok_ik2_99j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0181","start":181,"end":183,"surface":"次景","kind":"person","person_id":"qok_ik2_99j_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m026-0187","start":187,"end":189,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"qok_ik2_99j_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","book_id":"b-shiji-052","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p037","text":"齊王故為陽虛侯時，病甚，眾醫皆以為蹷。臣意診脈，以為痹，根在右脅下，大如覆杯，令人喘，逆氣不能食。臣意即以火齊粥且飲，六日氣下；即令更服丸藥，出入六日，病已。病得之內。診之時不能識其經解，大識其病所在。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m037-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m037-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"陽虛侯","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m037-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m037-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","book_id":"b-shiji-105","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-105-bianque"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p043","text":"問臣意：「意方能知病死生，論藥用所宜，諸侯王大臣有嘗問意者不？及文王病時，不求意診治，何故？」對曰：「趙王、膠西王、濟南王、吳王皆使人來召臣意，臣意不敢往。文王病時，臣意家貧，欲為人治病，誠恐吏以除拘臣意也，故移名數，左右不修家生，出行游國中，問善為方數者事之久矣，見事數師，悉受其要事，盡其方書意，及解論之。身居陽虛侯國，因事侯。侯入朝，臣意從之長安，以故得診安陵項處等病也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"ycr_d4w_b0x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"dsw_072_bp0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"膠西王","kind":"person","person_id":"o8y_3ur_51e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"濟南王","kind":"person","person_id":"iot_q5p_yh1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"ycr_d4w_b0x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0164","start":164,"end":165,"surface":"侯","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0166","start":166,"end":167,"surface":"侯","kind":"person","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"臣意","kind":"person","person_id":"opr_t0a_l8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m043-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"項處","kind":"person","person_id":"vbv_64z_to1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-105-bianque","book_id":"b-shiji-105","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-105-bianque"}],"table_passages":[{"id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05","column":5,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"四月丙寅，孝王將閭元年。齊悼惠王子，故陽虛侯。","source_row":44,"source_column":6,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05-review-007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"將閭","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本格受封者本名與舊侯號同指，與052本名及前爵對讀；平昌與昌平、扐與勒等字序或字形各依見證保留，不將姓名當全域別名。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。","source_revision":5977113}]},{"id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05-review-013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"悼惠王","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本格封國、紀年、所載親屬及核讀篇文暫定同指；省稱限本格，不設為全域別名。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p090","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu","source_revision":2440965,"person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AB","quote":"長庶齊悼惠王肥"}]},{"id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05-review-019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"陽虛侯","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本格受封者本名與舊侯號同指，與052本名及前爵對讀；平昌與昌平、扐與勒等字序或字形各依見證保留，不將姓名當全域別名。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p024","person_id":"jc7_nxq_532","quote":"後一歲，孝文帝以所封悼惠王子分齊為王，齊孝王將閭以悼惠王子楊虛侯為齊王。故齊別郡盡以王悼惠王子：子志為濟北王，子辟光為濟南王，子賢為菑川王，子卬為膠西王，子雄渠為膠東王，與城陽、齊凡七王。","source_revision":5977113}]}],"table_id":"shiji-017","table_fragment_id":"shiji-017-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043","table_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r043-c05","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-017","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-017","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-017","source_revision":"2607010","source_header":["公元前","漢","楚","","","齊","","","","","","","荊","淮南","燕","趙","","","","","","梁","","","","淮陽","代","長沙"],"row_year":{"era":"BCE","value":164,"astronomical_year":-163,"precision":"year","status":"digital_editorial_equivalence","source_quote":"164","source_cell_id":"shiji-017-t1-r